+// TBQ3_TCQ — TurboQuant trellis-coded 3-bit quantization, decode-only path.
+//
+// Block layout (block_tbq3_tcq, ggml-common.h):
+//   ggml_half d;       // fp16 per-block L2 norm (Viterbi-corrected)
